@frame down_0 shift=_front,0,-1
@frame down_1 shift=_front,0,0
@frame down_2 shift=_front,0,-1
@frame _side_up shift=_side,0,-1
@frame left_0 mirror=_side_up
@frame left_1 mirror=_side
@frame left_2 mirror=_side_up
@frame right_0 shift=_side,0,-1
@frame right_1 shift=_side,0,0
@frame right_2 shift=_side,0,-1
@frame up_0 shift=_back,0,-1
